&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;这个竞赛由&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modulum&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3072585&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607628691&quot; alt=&quot;Modulum&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3072585)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modulum&quot;  &gt;Modulum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;和&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=778357&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607628691&quot; alt=&quot;ProcyonLotor&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=778357)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor&quot;  &gt;ProcyonLotor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;组织。规则主要由&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modulum&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3072585&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607628691&quot; alt=&quot;Modulum&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3072585)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modulum&quot;  &gt;Modulum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;所写，并被&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=778357&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607628691&quot; alt=&quot;ProcyonLotor&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=778357)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor&quot;  &gt;ProcyonLotor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;略微修改。计时器由&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmagnus&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=318209&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607628691&quot; alt=&quot;DrMagnus&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=318209)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmagnus&quot;  &gt;DrMagnus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;所制，队伍中心格式为&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607628691&quot; alt=&quot;djkaktus&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus&quot;  &gt;djkaktus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;所修改。&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/esperanza-cai&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4113182&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607628691&quot; alt=&quot;Esperanza_Cai&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4113182)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/esperanza-cai&quot;  &gt;Esperanza_Cai&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
